  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Browse the bins (MAGs) of several metagenome samples by quality and taxonomy, inspect how complete their KEGG pathways are, look up KEGG orthologs, and compare samples or bins with heatmaps, scatterplots, PCA and taxonomy composition charts. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
